{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"观念"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"形变"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"形变"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对于一族参数化的结构 (常为"},{"Local":{"url":"相对","text":"相对"}},{"Plain":"结构), <strong>形变</strong> (deformation) 是其参数的延拓. 常常人们只关心参数的无穷小延拓, 即<strong>无穷小形变</strong>.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>概形的形变</h3>\n<p>设 $X$ 是光滑 $k$-代数簇, $(Y,y_0)$ 是带基点"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":". $X$ 在 $(Y,y_0)$ 上的<strong>形变</strong>是一个平坦"},{"Local":{"url":"紧合映射","text":"紧合映射"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal X\\to Y$ 与一个同构 $\\psi\\colon X\\to \\varphi^{-1}(y_0)$.</p>\n<p><strong>一阶无穷小形变</strong>是 $(\\operatorname{Spec}k[x]/(x^2),(x))$ 之上的形变.</p>\n<h4>曲线的无穷小形变</h4>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"曲线","text":"曲线"}},{"Plain":" $C$ 的无穷小形变的空间即为"},{"Local":{"url":"模空间","text":"模空间"}},{"Plain":"的切空间, 由此可计算模空间的维数. 由 "},{"Local":{"url":"Serre对偶","text":"Serre 对偶"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\nH^1(C,T_C) \\simeq H^0 (C,T^\\vee_C\\otimes\\omega_C)^\\vee \\simeq H^0(C,\\omega_C^{\\otimes 2}),\r\n$$\n后一个等式是因为 $T_C^\\vee=\\omega_C$; 又由 "},{"Local":{"url":"Riemann--Roch定理","text":"Riemann–Roch 定理"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\n\\dim H^0 (C,\\omega_C^{\\otimes 2})- \\dim H^1(C,\\omega_C^{\\otimes 2})=\\deg(\\omega^{\\otimes 2})+g-1=3g-3,\r\n$$\n又因为 $H^1(C,\\omega_C^{\\otimes 2})=0$ (为什么?), 所以曲线模空间的维数为\n$$\r\n\\dim H^1(C,T_C)=3g-3.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>到法锥的形变</h3>\n<p>见"},{"Local":{"url":"法形变","text":"法形变"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}